    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "200mg of aspirin every 4 hours? that seems like a lot to take just for some vision stuff. and i've heard that caffeine makes migraines worse, so is stopping coffee totally necessary? i'm just worried that if i start taking pills constantly i'll end up with stomach issues or something. is there like a more natural way to handle this without the aspirin?",
